OL,3,A'Careless use of AI is the real threat
OL,4,A- not the ghost stories'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains strong
OL,7,Flanguage.
OL,9,FMeredith Whittaker has little patience
OL,10,Ffor the AI doom that dominates
OL,11,Fheadlines - she thinks warnings of AI
OL,12,Fturning on humanity is a fear "not
OL,13,Fanchored in science".
OL,15,F"The risk is very real," says the boss
OL,16,Fof the Signal Foundation, which runs
OL,17,Fthe encrypted messaging app of the same
OL,18,Fname, "but it's not the shiny ghost
OL,19,Fstories the wild-eyed boys are talking
OL,20,Fabout".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
